{"server":"tw","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_07_end","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_07","title":"揭幕時刻","storyCode":"PV-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"49f4312853758874025a6faac30603ab72833b028068cb6ce679c7ff4a2fdc50","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_vipward"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月7日    12:00 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的市民們，午安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"籌備數月之久的狂歡節將在十一月九日晚上如期舉行，屆時數十萬市民將走上街頭，慶祝新沃爾西尼落成一周年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"根據狂歡節籌委會透露，所有的野獸花車已在新沃爾西尼港完成組裝，今日將轉移向拓展地塊，為巡遊做準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"街頭戲劇競演也已經落下帷幕，俘獲最多觀眾的團隊將獲得在狂歡節當夜代表全體市民點亮花車的資格……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其他入圍劇碼屆時也將配合花車，在市民們巡遊的道路兩側進行演出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"籌委會呼籲大家，保持花車在正式亮相前的神秘感！請務必按捺好奇心，不要前往窺探、偷拍或傳播花車造型！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另外，十一月五日深夜，港口區第五大街發生了一起交通事故，現場有一人受傷，肇事車輛逃逸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"警方很快控制了現場，恢復了第五大街的秩序，該事故並未造成嚴重影響，請市民們不必驚慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目前警方已成立專案小組，在全城範圍內調查肇事車輛，不日便將偵破此案。各位市民如發現相關線索，也請盡快聯絡警方……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我過來看看，晚一點再去法院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生過來了三趟……但都是正常檢查，也沒說其他的——起碼沒有惡化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的表情，昨天你臨時要處理的那個案子並不順利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"案子結了……以一種我不願意看到卻又無能為力的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，我不記得你有收聽午間新聞的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況不像新聞通報裡說的那麼樂觀，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一些線索，也鎖定了一些嫌疑人，但沒什麼實際的進展。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有查過案發當晚報警的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下的都是假資料，不好查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我能幫上忙？城裡有不少我們再熟悉不過的人，家族那些……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，德克薩斯……我知道你始終在關注這件事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在沃爾西尼，你的出現足以牽動城市裡所有勢力的神經，激怒一些人，警醒一些人，讓事情出現轉機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在不是一年前，新沃爾西尼也不是沃爾西尼。在一座沒有家族的城市裡，“最後的德克薩斯”能做到的事情很有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，“最後的德克薩斯”在這裡不應該還能做到那麼多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"護理師","speakerId":"avg_npc_702_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯小姐，前台有一通電話，是找您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，德克薩斯，需要用車嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可不會等你太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明這兩天都艷陽高照的，怎麼突然之間就暴雨傾盆了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真正驚訝的人，可不會隨身帶著一把傘哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這邊這邊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"計程車的引擎蓋上，黑色的巨大雨傘下，司機無聊地把玩著手中的鑰匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，來得很快嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"司機緩緩抬起雨傘，露出弧度誇張的嘴角——那是一個很肆意的微笑。隨後她若無其事地將雨傘丟開，向德克薩斯致意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在簡直讓我想起了我們的老家，沃爾西尼的夜和雨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，這座新城市好像天氣一直很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過看來你早就預料到會下雨了啊，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是有備無患，這裡畢竟還是敘拉古。這麼久才有這麼一場暴雨，已經是稀奇事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那場車禍到底是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是說貝洛內家那個市長幼崽？哈哈哈哈，你總不會懷疑我開著這輛計程車撞了他吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果是你，我也並不意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟完全和你無關的話，你根本不會出現在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我確實知道一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"願意讓我這個司機載你一程嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，有何不可？不然我根本不會出現在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我還以為你會幫我撐傘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看你在雨裡滿享受的，不想破壞你的興致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，不愧是德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要一直保持這個姿勢嗎？這麼大的雨，也沒有觀眾，累不累？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，原來你不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"趕快上車，德克薩斯。我們要去的地方不算近，開車得要一陣子呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，副駕駛上有為你準備的見面禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到食品盒子了……我現在沒胃口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放心，這次不是千層酥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我早就換口味了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過我知道，你依舊還是癡迷於那些老習慣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_vipward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯？這麼快就回來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……德米特里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不應該有權限進入這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總有辦法，你也不能一直不讓我見萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶了一束花，唔，病房裡有適合的花瓶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前貝洛內家常放這種玫瑰，拉維妮婭，你也不陌生吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別用這種眼神看著我，拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據你的安排，這兩天，警察已經對我案發前後的所有行程進行了查證，鉅細靡遺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但沒有任何線索能夠證明我與那場車禍有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還不至於蠢到認為你做一些見不得人的事時會親自動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市政廳的同事向我透露，他們最近收到了薩盧佐酒業的經營主體變更申請……德米特里，你在和阿爾貝托合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市，或者說，你們既然對我沒那麼歡迎，我要想留下來，總得想點辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不符合規定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……完全符合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那讓我待在你的視線範圍內，不是更好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們部署在醫院的警力足以盯緊我的一舉一動，和誰有過接觸，又向誰下達了命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，我都應該來看看萊昂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前他生病的時候，也都是我在照顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭，貝洛內不會放棄進入新沃爾西尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但無論如何，我都沒有必要，也絕對不會去傷害萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會替萊昂收下你的花，德米特里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但抱歉，從司法流程上，我不會允許潛在的嫌疑人直接私下見受害者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……萊昂的安危，已經與這座城市息息相關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人能保證，接下來的混亂會從什麼地方開始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這就是你想要讓我看到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來剛剛那場雨還是不夠大啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火。\n急速行駛的計程車離熊熊火焰不遠時突然急煞，在尚且濕潤的地面上留下了清晰的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我說，我是帶你來滅火的，你會信嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"猙獰的狼口中吞吐著火焰，濃煙滾滾。\n野獸模樣的巨型花車燃燒著，火光在陰沉的天空之下異常顯眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……拉普蘭德，你到底知道什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"懷疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，如果是你的話，應該會選擇更古典更吸睛的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起碼這時你也應該在火場中央，而不是我身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，還是你瞭解我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過可惜，那些工人和警察的反應不慢，大概再過一陣子，火就會撲滅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們真應該感謝剛剛那場暴雨啊，不然這場火說不定會把整個新沃爾西尼港燒個精光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……無論火勢大不大，這把火已經在新沃爾西尼人面前燒起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂圖索他們希望用一個煥然一新的節日賦予這座新城市裡的數十萬人認同感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一起重傷代理市長的車禍、一場發生在物流港口的大火，狂歡節前夕，這兩件事情接連發生，足以讓普通民眾寢食難安……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不覺得像極了某種預兆、宣告，或者挑釁嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德，你知道多少內情？你的目的又是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，你聽起來很緊張——為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"新沃爾西尼本就是西西里夫人許諾給年輕人的試驗場，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然是試驗，結果難免有好有壞嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作為第一目擊者，我可以明確告訴你，貝洛內家那個幼崽的車禍是純粹的意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在醫院照顧他，他現在應該也已經脫離了生命危險，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你的緊張來自何處，德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我期待你的答案，德克薩斯……在狂歡節上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論你想做什麼，拉普蘭德……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會替拉維妮婭盯著你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，那就坐穩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒興趣浪費時間在那些警察的身上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼會？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花車……還有那些貨都被點燃了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜，是我。警察已經被引過來了，別暴露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳、柳德米拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前天晚上你去哪裡了？不對，你怎麼找來這裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的疑問更多，索默爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車禍後你去了哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我去找了伊雷妮，她打暈我後把我鎖在了倉庫——唉，總之發生了很多事，我也是好不容易才跑出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，所有人的注意力都在花車那邊，跟著我，煙可以幫助我們隱藏行跡，沒人能發現我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，你的衣角怎麼焦了一塊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火是你、你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我放的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再晚一點，警察就會發現那輛卡車，還有車廂裡的東西。這是唯一的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，先離開這裡再說。那些警察——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，柳德米拉，那邊剛剛來的人是……伊雷妮？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她身邊那個人又是誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮·拉瓦薩小姐，還有阿爾貝托·薩盧佐先生，能否請你們解釋一下，為什麼會出現在距離火場只有兩百公尺的地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有向你們解釋的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們需要我的回答，讓那位大法官把證據和羈押文件帶到我的面前吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我隨時恭候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們會的，阿爾貝托先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的確暫時沒有證據能證明你和這一次火災有關聯，但這不代表你和整件事無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，伊雷妮·拉瓦薩小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整輛花車都已經被燒得沒剩下什麼，但我們還是收集到了一些有用的殘片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍後我們會送去比對，但基本可以確定，用於製作花車的那輛載具，就是你們工會的卡車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為卡車工會的負責人，你需要跟我們回去接受調查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……阿爾貝托先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮小姐，我們之前的約定依舊有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你和這件事無關，但去了之後，小心自己說的每一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，我也幫不上你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月8日    10:00 A.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"熟悉的地方，不是嗎，德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這次，站在被告席上的人既不是你也不是我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算真按法官所言，這個案子涉嫌危害到新沃爾西尼的公共安全，也沒有理由讓這些人出動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"針對一個卡車司機的庭審，公眾席上卻坐滿了有利益衝突的兩個家族的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，我越來越喜歡新沃爾西尼了，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這場庭審來得真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是特別流程吧。明天就是狂歡節，法院想在那之前儘快了結這個案子，倒是不難理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這位伊雷妮，你認識她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必試探我，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只和這個可憐的小司機有過一面之緣，但我卻能猜到她的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，她是無辜的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事情在敘拉古這座泥潭並不新鮮，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它遲早會吞掉所有人，也不是每個人都能像你一樣有能力逃脫的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛被殺人滅口，要嘛躲進泥水裡苟且偷生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你相信新沃爾西尼能給出第三條路嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"肅靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"依據《新都市管理法案》，新沃爾西尼刑事法庭，新沃爾西尼公訴港口縱火案，案號00278，開庭審理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被告人，請陳述你的身分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮·拉瓦薩，原籍西西里城，現在是卡車工會的成員，住在都靈區亞力托大街的卡車營地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g9_truckcamp"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫我們的證詞在法庭上是無效的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們就只能在這等著伊雷妮的審判結果出來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我比你更想去法庭，柳德米拉。畢竟伊雷妮是因為我才……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也聽說她在警察局的表現了，她什麼都沒有說……不能有更多的人牽扯進去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她相信市政廳和法院，也相信自己能證明自己的清白……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這等著我，索默爾。我去召集其他人，無論如何，我們現在應該站在她的身邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"索默爾癱坐在地上抱著頭，望著柳德米拉離開的方向。\n如果他沒有瞞著伊雷妮幫威尼斯運貨，如果沒有那場車禍，如果他沒有去找伊雷妮求助，如果他能早一點掙脫那些鐵鏈去到港口……\n事情因他而起，但現在站在法庭上受審的卻是自己最好的朋友，自己的……女兒。\n他從身上摸索出一張名片，他不知道是誰把它塞進了自己房車的門裡。\n名片上只有一個地址——“港口碼頭三區”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，我知道平時我頭腦遠沒你靈活……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這次，我知道我一定能幫上你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他站起身，獨自離開了營地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮·拉瓦薩，與市政廳身分登記的資訊相符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"昨天港口的那場大火，造成了嚴重的財產損失，使現場的數十位工人險些受傷，嚴重威脅到了新沃爾西尼的公共安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"臨近狂歡節，這樣的事件更是會引發難以估計的輿論影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法庭查驗了警方提交的證據，起火點，也就是巨狼花車，存在明顯的人為縱火痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那輛卡車來自卡車工會，警方比對了排班表，它最近根本沒有出車安排，不應該出現在新沃爾西尼港。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你作為卡車工會的負責人，卻碰巧就在火場——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮女士，你是最大的嫌疑人。你有為自己辯解的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官先生，我很樂意陳述我所知道的一切。"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊雷妮鎮定地闡述著自己所知道的一切，試圖證明昨天的火災與卡車互助會的任何一個人都無關。\n但法官的臉色卻越來越差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哪怕法官想要幫她也無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然了，只要真正縱火的人沒有露面，她所有的自辯都是這麼無力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，唉，可憐的人。你不想幫幫她嗎，德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如站起來替她擔保之類的，如果是你的話，說不定法院會網開一面哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在想什麼，拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃爾西尼的法律容不得被如此踐踏和輕視，這是拉維妮婭他們好不容易爭取來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那恐怕你只能袖手旁觀囉，或者……"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉普蘭德躍躍欲試，挑釁地看著德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不在乎你們那套無聊的規矩。想要我幫你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，稍等，法庭收到了一份補充名單，有新的證人希望能夠出庭作證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……阿、阿爾貝托·薩盧佐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，法官閣下，作為一個嚴格按照《新都市管理法案》完成了身分登記的合法市民，我的證詞難道不足以被法庭採信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……當、當然可以，請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托先生，你是要向法庭補充證據，證明伊雷妮確實與那場大火有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿爾貝托沒有回答，他的眼神落在了證人席的對面，公眾席的左邊，那裡坐著小威尼斯和他家族的成員。\n而在小威尼斯斜後方不遠處，他看到了自己的女兒——被驅逐的薩盧佐。\n拉普蘭德翹著腿，咧著嘴，旁若無人地向他揮手。\n她的旁邊還跟著德克薩斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（Ciao~）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，我親愛的父親在看著我們呢，別這麼拘謹，招招手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托先生、阿爾貝托先生？請您進行陳述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以證明，伊雷妮小姐並沒有縱火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三區，應該就是在這邊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"索默爾？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆讓我們在這等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，他要見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是威尼斯家族的人？還是薩盧佐家族？美第奇……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這能幫到伊雷妮對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在前面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轉角的那個貨櫃，推門進去就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以保證自己陳述的所有事情絕對真實。如我剛才所言，從昨天上午，一直到新沃爾西尼港失火，她都和我在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐酒業的兩個葡萄園馬上就要首次採收，我希望卡車工會到時候能調撥一支車隊協助我們轉運採摘好的新果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們才會去港口查看情況，我的員工們也都可以證明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公眾席上的家族成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（紛紛附和的聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換言之，伊雷妮小姐有充分的不在場證明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（鼓掌）真精彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那精明的父親把卡車工會與薩盧佐家族綁在了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位可憐的司機小姐以後怕是只能唯他是從囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情恐怕不會這麼簡單結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那輛貨車來自卡車工會，我們查看了排班表，這兩天都沒有安排它出車，它為什麼會出現在港口，又被裝飾成了花車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮小姐，哪怕你確實不是縱火者，但作為工會的負責人，你仍需對這次違規用車進行解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"關於這一點，我可以為伊雷妮小姐作證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官閣下，補充證據裡有一份報關單請您過目。那輛卡車，本來是在為威尼斯載具公司運送輪胎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡，進去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"貨櫃的門半掩著，索默爾只能看到黑漆漆的貨櫃內閃爍著微弱的燈光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，到底是誰能幫我……還有伊雷妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的廢話真多，老頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你進去了自然就知道誰在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想幫那個司機，我們也想，你知道這麼多就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"索默爾摸到了貨櫃的門，他猶豫著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們能保證嗎——"},{"type":"narration","text":"無人回答，家族成員已經走遠了，現在只剩他獨自一人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼奧先生，你應該清楚這項陳述意味著什麼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托先生說他出庭作證只是出於公民素養，但這件事卻與威尼斯載具公司有實際的關聯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為狂歡節，這兩個月城內的用車需求陡增，我們不得不臨時向其他城市加訂了一批載具耗材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這批新到港的貨物已經通過了報關流程，卡車工會在幫我們轉運，因為是臨時需求，他們那邊還沒來得及同步到排班表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮小姐，如果有錯，你可以糾正我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是的，紙本的單據都能查到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於那輛車為什麼會出現在港口，又是被誰混到了花車隊伍裡，我們確實不得而知，還有賴警方繼續調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_1544_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少卡車工會不存在違規用車的情況，伊雷妮小姐在整件事情中沒有那麼大的過失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"法官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我們會去確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個可憐的司機運氣不錯，結果差不多明朗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親和小威尼斯的證詞很關鍵，足夠洗清伊雷妮的嫌疑，她不會有什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但嫌疑人自己反倒成了局外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為當事人，伊雷妮幾乎插不上任何話，法庭完全變成了威尼斯和薩盧佐的舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩批人，明明私下裡爭來鬥去，一到法庭上卻又出奇地配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族如何行事，我們都很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想要把自己撇清，還想要徹底掌握卡車工會，就一定會有所行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然，畢竟真正放火的人還沒找到呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者除非，他永遠也不會被找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，家族索討回報可從來不在乎當事人自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我得聯絡拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"他深呼吸兩次後，推開貨櫃的門走了進去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索默爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1547_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有人？"},{"type":"narration","text":"貨櫃內只有一盞燈，一把椅子，什麼人也沒有。\n索默爾愣住了。\n他決定等等，如果這能幫到伊雷妮……\n他願意再等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三區，他來的應該就是這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這地方這麼大，我要怎麼找他。"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉焦急地穿梭在貨櫃搭建起來的小巷之間，試圖找到索默爾的蹤跡。\n直到她聽到了不遠處的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，狂歡節之後去哪裡度假？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾西尼？老牌的歌舞劇院都在那裡，我打算去高雅一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還是覺得特爾尼城更好，聽說那裡的俱樂部有玻利瓦爾來的佩洛舞男跳脫衣舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，你是薩盧佐家的人，真要去最好把尾巴藏好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那我倒也可以跟你推薦幾個沃爾西尼的黃牛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你人不錯，辦事也俐落，要是在威尼斯混不下去，可以來找我，我幫你引薦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那還是算了。抽一根嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，這打火機還滿好用的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉看到了侃侃而談的兩人，但她完全不在乎他們說了什麼。\n她只是注意到了對方手裡把玩著的金色打火機。\n柳德米拉知道那個打火機，也知道那兩頭狼壓根不是它的主人，它屬於一個不抽煙的司機。\n……\n柳德米拉不知道的是，那本來就是家族的東西。\n兜兜轉轉的，它如今又回到了家族的手裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
